   <div class="buds-intro"> 
    <!-- KV --> 
    <div class="buds-kv"> 
     <div class="common__inner"> 
      <div class="buds-kv__logo"> 
       <strong class="blind">Galaxy Buds4 Pro</strong> 
       <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
        <use xlink:href="#buds-kv-logo" href="#buds-kv-logo"></use> 
       </svg> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
     <div class="buds-kv__image"> 
      <picture> 
       <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-kv.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
       <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-kv-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
       <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-kv.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A pair of white Galaxy Buds4 Pro hover with the left earbud slightly lower than the right." data-copy-set="C01-001"> 
      </picture> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
    <div id="budsMediaQuote" class="buds-media-quote" role="region" aria-label="Media Reviews"> 
     <div class="common__inner"> 
      <div class="buds-media-quote__wrap swiper-container"> 
       <ul class="buds-media-quote__list swiper-wrapper" role="list"> 
        <li class="buds-media-quote__item swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
         <div class="buds-media-quote__content"> 
          <p class="buds-media-quote__text" data-copy-set="C01-008">"The Galaxy Buds4 Pro are extremely recommendable. I absolutely love the sound quality in them. The fit and the comfort are incredible. The microphones are really, really impressive. And they have pretty much every feature I would want. These are not only a jack of all trades, but also a master of quite a few as well."</p> 
          <div class="buds-media-quote__byline"> 
           <strong class="buds-media-quote__media" data-copy-set="C01-009">Mike O'Brien</strong> 
          </div> 
         </div> </li> 
        <li class="buds-media-quote__item swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
         <div class="buds-media-quote__content"> 
          <p class="buds-media-quote__text" data-copy-set="C01-010">"Your music will sound fuller with more delicate and precise high tones and an impactful (but not overwhelming) bassline rounding out your scores."</p> 
          <div class="buds-media-quote__byline"> 
           <strong class="buds-media-quote__media" data-copy-set="C01-011">TechRadar, 02/2026</strong> 
          </div> 
         </div> </li> 
        <li class="buds-media-quote__item swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
         <div class="buds-media-quote__content"> 
          <p class="buds-media-quote__text" data-copy-set="C01-012">"The Galaxy Buds4 Pro deliver a warm sound that's tuned for the mainstream: bass is ample, without being overpowering, vocals are clean, and the high-end gives a great impression of detail. Tool's Parabola hits hard on the chorus, but I was still able to pick out individual instruments."</p> 
          <div class="buds-media-quote__byline"> 
           <strong class="buds-media-quote__media" data-copy-set="C01-013">Stuff</strong> 
          </div> 
         </div> </li> 
       </ul> 
       <ul class="buds-media-quote__pagination swiper-pagination" role="list" data-tagging="gbuds4pro:features:highlights^media-quote:index"></ul> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
   </div> 
   <!-- Highlight --> 
   <div id="highlights" class="buds-highlight"> 
    <div class="common__inner"> 
     <h2 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C02-001">MEET THE TRUE HI-FI GALAXY BUDS</h2> 
    </div> 
    <div class="buds-highlight__inner"> 
     <button type="button" class="buds-highlight__player">disable automatic slideshow</button> 
     <div class="buds-highlight__container swiper-container" data-start-point="30" data-reverse-point="80" data-mo-start-point="30" data-mo-reverse-point="60"> 
      <div class="buds-highlight__list swiper-wrapper" role="list"> 
       <div class="buds-highlight__item swiper-slide" data-media-type="video" role="listitem"> 
        <h3 class="buds-highlight__title" data-copy-set="C02-002">Advanced 2-way Speaker</h3> 
        <div class="buds-highlight__media"> 
         <div class="common-video"> 
          <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
           <video playsinline muted preload="none" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-j7u3m" data-src-pc="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-01.mp4" data-src-mobile="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-01-mo.mp4" aria-label="The two earbuds are placed side by side. A booming effect slightly shakes the earbuds, indicating the powerful sound Galaxy Buds4 Pro produces." data-copy-set="C02-004"></video> 
           <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-wx4hd"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-01-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-01-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-01-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
           </picture> 
          </figure> 
          <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Advanced 2-way Speaker video" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:highlights^2-way-speaker:movi-play:main-movie" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="feature" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:highlights^2-way-speaker:movi-play:main-movie"> 
           <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-play" href="#wearable-video-play" class="play"></use> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-pause" href="#wearable-video-pause" class="pause"></use> 
           </svg> <span class="blind">pause</span> </button> 
         </div> 
        </div> 
        <p class="buds-highlight__description" data-copy-set="C02-003">From deeper, richer lows powered by a <strong>wider woofer</strong> to clear highs, the advanced 2-way Speaker delivers a complete, balanced sound.</p> 
       </div> 
       <div class="buds-highlight__item swiper-slide" data-media-type="image" role="listitem"> 
        <h3 class="buds-highlight__title" data-copy-set="C02-005">Design</h3> 
        <div class="buds-highlight__media"> 
         <div class="common-video loaded"> 
          <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
           <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-gq1zs"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-02-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-02-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-02-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A person wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro while looking toward the left." data-copy-set="C02-007"> 
           </picture> 
          </figure> 
          <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Design"> 
           <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-play" href="#wearable-video-play" class="play"></use> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-pause" href="#wearable-video-pause" class="pause"></use> 
           </svg> <span class="blind">pause</span> </button> 
         </div> 
        </div> 
        <p class="buds-highlight__description" data-copy-set="C02-006">Iconic in metal, shaped for <strong>all-day comfort</strong>. The <strong>real metal blade</strong> defines both design and control. Ergonomic contours create a secure, natural fit that stays comfortable from morning to night.</p> 
        <p></p> 
       </div> 
       <div class="buds-highlight__item swiper-slide" data-media-type="image" role="listitem"> 
        <h3 class="buds-highlight__title" data-copy-set="C02-008">Ultra High Quality Audio</h3> 
        <div class="buds-highlight__media"> 
         <div class="common-video loaded"> 
          <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
           <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-s9v0h"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-03-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-03-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-03-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="Galaxy smartphone with the 'Advanced quality options' screen open. On the screen, 'Ultra high quality (UHQ) audio' is turned on and the 'Super wide band speech' is turned off. Next to the screen is a pair of white, Galaxy Buds4 Pro." data-copy-set="C02-010"> 
           </picture> 
          </figure> 
          <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Ultra High Quality Audio"> 
           <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-play" href="#wearable-video-play" class="play"></use> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-pause" href="#wearable-video-pause" class="pause"></use> 
           </svg> <span class="blind">pause</span> </button> 
         </div> 
        </div> 
        <p class="buds-highlight__description" data-copy-set="C02-009"> Ultra High Quality Audio with <strong>24-bit / 96 kHz</strong> reveals every layer, making the world feel richer and more alive.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title=" disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a></sup> </p> 
       </div> 
       <div class="buds-highlight__item swiper-slide" data-media-type="image" role="listitem"> 
        <h3 class="buds-highlight__title" data-copy-set="C02-011">Super Clear Call</h3> 
        <div class="buds-highlight__media"> 
         <div class="common-video loaded"> 
          <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
           <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-4r3yq"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-04-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-04-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-04-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="Two Galaxy smartphones are on each side with a pair of white, Galaxy Buds4 Pro in the middle. Between the earbuds is a phone call icon. The smartphone on the left shows the call screen with the name 'Ava' and the smartphone on the right shows the call screen with the name 'Sam'. In the background are multiple waves showcasing the Super Clear Call feature available on Galaxy Buds4 Pro." data-copy-set="C02-013"> 
           </picture> 
          </figure> 
          <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Super Clear Call"> 
           <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-play" href="#wearable-video-play" class="play"></use> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-pause" href="#wearable-video-pause" class="pause"></use> 
           </svg> <span class="blind">pause</span> </button> 
         </div> 
        </div> 
        <p class="buds-highlight__description" data-copy-set="C02-012"> Your voice is captured clearly by <strong>advanced machine-learned DNN</strong>, even in noisy moments, and delivered pure and effortless through <strong>Super Wideband.</strong><sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a></sup> </p> 
       </div> 
       <div class="buds-highlight__item swiper-slide" data-media-type="video" role="listitem"> 
        <h3 class="buds-highlight__title" data-copy-set="C02-014">Charging Case</h3> 
        <div class="buds-highlight__media"> 
         <div class="common-video"> 
          <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
           <video playsinline muted preload="none" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-8m2p4" data-src-pc="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-05.mp4" data-src-mobile="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-05-mo.mp4" aria-label="A pair of Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbuds above the open Charging Case. The earbuds are placed inside and the Charging Case spins clockwise. The lid closes. The Charging Case is placed on a wireless charging pad which lights up as the battery indicator light on the case turns on." data-copy-set="C02-016"></video> 
           <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-q5x9n"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-05-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-05-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-highlight-05-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
           </picture> 
          </figure> 
          <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Charging Case video" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:highlights^charging-case:movi-play:main-movie" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="feature" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:highlights^charging-case:movi-play:main-movie"> 
           <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-play" href="#wearable-video-play" class="play"></use> 
            <use xlink:href="#wearable-video-pause" href="#wearable-video-pause" class="pause"></use> 
           </svg> <span class="blind">pause</span> </button> 
         </div> 
        </div> 
        <p class="buds-highlight__description" data-copy-set="C02-015">From clean, sculptural form to smooth magnetic docking, the <strong>Charging Case</strong> turns everyday use into a refined experience.</p> 
