   <!-- Clear Call --> 
   <div id="super-clear-call" class="buds-clear-call black-theme"> 
    <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible"> 
     <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C13-01">SUPER CLEAR CALL</h3> 
     <p class="common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C13-02">Super Clear Call, even in noise</p> 
    </div> 
    <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C13-03"> Even your calls are clear like Hi-Fi audio. Your voice is clearly captured by 6 microphones positioned around your head, intelligently isolating it from the background sound with <strong>advanced Deep Neural Network (DNN)</strong>. The exceptionally clean voice signal is transmitted with pure effortlessness through <strong>Super Wideband (SWB)</strong> up to 16 kHz between your Galaxy Buds4 Pro and Galaxy smartphone. Hear and be heard, loud and clear — even in noisy moments.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-9"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-10"></a></sup> </p> 
    <div class="buds-gallery__wrap buds-gallery__mobile"> 
     <div class="buds-gallery__big-image"> 
      <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-x9v0n"> 
       <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
       <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-clearcall-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
       <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-clearcall-mo.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
      </picture> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
    <div class="buds-gallery__wrap"> 
     <div class="buds-gallery__big-image"> 
      <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-p8s2q"> 
       <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
       <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-clearcall.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
       <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-clearcall.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
      </picture> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
    <p class="blind" data-copy-set="C13-04">Two Galaxy smartphones are on each side with a pair of white, Galaxy Buds4 Pro in the middle. Between the earbuds is a phone call icon. The smartphone on the left shows the call screen with the name 'Ava' and the smartphone on the right shows the call screen with the name 'Sam'. In the background are multiple waves showcasing the Super Clear Call feature available on Galaxy Buds4 Pro.</p> 
   </div> 
   <div id="buds-parallax02" class="buds-parallax"> 
    <div class="buds-parallax__top"> 
     <!-- 360 Audio --> 
     <div id="360-audio" class="buds-360-audio black-theme"> 
      <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible"> 
       <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C14-01">360 AUDIO</h3> 
       <p class="common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C14-02">Surround yourself in sound</p> 
      </div> 
      <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C14-03"> <strong>Expand your soundstage</strong> from stereo into a grand orchestral hall or a large arena, placing you at the center of a live performance with a single touch. Feel every instrument and vocals in three dimensions, surrounding you with natural depth and spacious clarity. You don't just hear the music — you're enveloped by the atmosphere all around you.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-8"></a></sup> </p> 
      <div class="buds-gallery__wrap buds-gallery__mobile"> 
       <div class="buds-360-audio__image"> 
        <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-q8t3f"> 
         <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
         <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-360audio-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
         <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-360audio-mo.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
        </picture> 
       </div> 
      </div> 
      <div class="buds-360-audio__image"> 
       <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-0f7w3"> 
        <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
        <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-360audio.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
        <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-sound-360audio.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
       </picture> 
      </div> 
      <p class="blind" data-copy-set="C14-04">A man sitting on a couch as a collection of instruments appear in a circle around him. The instruments include a mic with a mic stand, a drum set, trumpet, cello, violin, electric guitar and grand piano. The instruments are shown in outline, highlighting the 360 Audio system available on Galaxy Buds4 Pro.</p> 
      <div class="buds-360-audio__howto"> 
       <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="common-cta-howto common-cta-howto--white js-layer-opener js-howto-popup-opener" aria-label="How to get the most from your Hi-Fi sound. Open video popup" data-target-layer="#layer-popup-how-to" data-youtube-id="l-i1CO8W5dQ" data-youtube-title="How to get the most from your Hi-Fi sound" data-howto-slide="how-to-use-hi-fi-sound"> 
        <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
         <use xlink:href="#wearable-play-button" href="#wearable-play-button"></use> 
        </svg> <span data-copy-set="C14-05">How to get the most out of your Hi-Fi sound</span> <span class="blind" aria-hidden="true" data-copy-set="C14-07">Galaxy Buds4 Pro next to a Galaxy smartphone, explaining how to pair and experience full-spectrum Hi-Fi sound. Galaxy Bud4 Pro Charging Case opens and a pop-up appears on the screen of the Galaxy smartphone. "Connect" is tapped to pair the devices. The first section explains how to get the right fit with a single Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbud placed in an ear canal, moving slightly up and down to demonstrate a comfortable fit. The next section explains how to check the fit by opening the Quick Panel and tapping the Settings icon on the Galaxy smartphone. Then, selecting "Christina's Buds4 Pro", "Sound quality and effects", "Earbud fit test" and "Start" to begin. A short test sound plays and a “Keep your earbuds in” notification appears while the fit test runs. The results indicate whether the fit is good or poor. The next section introduces advanced sound settings. In the earbuds settings menu, tap "Sound quality and effects", "Advanced quality options" and toggle on "Ultra high quality (UHQ) audio" for Hi-Fi sound. For clearer calls, toggle on "Super wide band speech". To tailor your sound, tap "Equalizer" on the "Sound quality and effects" menu, select '"Custom" and manually adjust according to your personal preferences. Toggle on "360 audio" to experience surround sound or switch between "Active noise canceling", "Adaptive" and "Ambient sound" modes. In the final scene, a Galaxy smartphone between a pair of Galaxy Buds4 Pro spins around as circular ripples appear in the background, representing sound waves. The video ends with the Galaxy smartphone tilted on its side, showing the rear cameras, and Galaxy Buds4 Pro floating slightly above the smartphone, with the left earbud slightly higher than the right.</span> </a> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
    <div class="buds-parallax__bottom"> 
     <div class="buds-parallax__inner"> 
