   <!-- Seamless Connection (Card) --> 
   <div id="one-ui" class="buds-seamless-connection"> 
    <div class="common__inner visible-swiper"> 
     <div class="buds-seamless-connection__container swiper-container"> 
      <ul class="buds-seamless-connection__list swiper-wrapper" role="list"> 
       <li class="buds-seamless-connection__item buds-seamless-connection__item--left swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
        <div class="buds-seamless-connection__item-inner"> 
         <div class="buds-seamless-connection__text"> 
          <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible" data-visible-mo="swiper"> 
           <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C21-01">EASY PAIRING</h3> 
           <p class="buds-seamless-connection__title common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C21-02">Simple connection. Straight to the tunes</p> 
          </div> 
          <p class="buds-seamless-connection__description" data-copy-set="C21-03"> Just open the Charging Case and you’re all set — as simple as that. <strong>No apps, no downloads</strong> and of course, no hassle. Your Galaxy smartphone and Galaxy Tab detect Galaxy Buds4 Pro for easy pairing.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-12"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-13"></a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-14"></a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-15"></a></sup> </p> 
         </div> 
         <div class="buds-seamless-connection__media-wrap"> 
          <div class="buds-seamless-connection__media"> 
           <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-v5q7g"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-easypairing.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-easypairing-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-easypairing.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A Galaxy smartphone with the Easy Pairing pop-up on screen, showing how simple it is to connect to the Galaxy Buds4 Pro. On the right side of Galaxy smartphone is Galaxy Buds4 Pro, docked in the Charging Case with the lid open." data-copy-set="C21-04"> 
           </picture> 
          </div> 
         </div> 
        </div> </li> 
       <li class="buds-seamless-connection__item buds-seamless-connection__item--right swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
        <div class="buds-seamless-connection__item-inner"> 
         <div class="buds-seamless-connection__text"> 
          <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible" data-visible-mo="swiper"> 
           <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C22-01">ONE UI <span>8.5</span></h3> 
           <p class="buds-seamless-connection__title common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C22-02">Now, everything flows as one in One UI</p> 
          </div> 
          <p class="buds-seamless-connection__description" data-copy-set="C22-03"> The evolved One UI 8.5 creates a deep connection between your Galaxy Buds and Galaxy smartphone, almost like a duet. Control has never been more intuitive — manage features from the device settings, without downloading a separate app. From the Quick Panel, you can easily access features and also set and save <strong>sound preferences for each app</strong>.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-16"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-17"></a></sup> </p> 
         </div> 
         <div class="buds-seamless-connection__media-wrap"> 
          <div class="buds-seamless-connection__media"> 
           <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-v1r0p"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A Galaxy smartphone with the Quick Panel open, focusing on the new One UI 8.5. Bluetooth, volume, noise canceling features are highlighted." data-copy-set="C22-04"> 
           </picture> 
          </div> 
          <div class="buds-seamless-connection__media buds-seamless-connection__media-top"> 
           <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-e5j2g"> 
            <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
            <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui-panel.png?imbypass=true"> 
            <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui-panel-mo.png?imbypass=true"> 
            <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-oneui-panel.png?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
           </picture> 
          </div> 
         </div> 
        </div> </li> 
      </ul> 
      <div class="buds-seamless-connection__pagination"> 
       <ul class="buds-seamless-connection__pagination-list swiper-pagination" role="list" data-tagging="gbuds4pro:features:galaxy-experience:index"></ul> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
    <div class="buds-seamless-connection__howto"> 
     <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="common-cta-howto js-layer-opener js-howto-popup-opener" aria-label="How to easily connect and use. Open video popup" data-target-layer="#layer-popup-how-to" data-youtube-id="T5n8o6A0Lp0" data-youtube-title="How to easily connect and use" data-howto-slide="how-to-use-easily-connect"> 
      <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
       <use xlink:href="#wearable-play-button" href="#wearable-play-button"></use> 
      </svg> <span data-copy-set="C22-05">How to easily connect and use</span> <span class="blind" aria-hidden="true" data-copy-set="C22-07">Galaxy Buds4 Pro next to a Galaxy smartphone, explaining how to easily pair and use the two devices. Galaxy Bud4 Pro Charging Case opens and a pop-up appears on the screen of the Galaxy smartphone. "Connect" is tapped to pair the devices. On-screen tips and guides appear, explaining touch controls and head gestures. The next section introduces available settings on Galaxy Buds4 Pro. A Galaxy smartphone appears, swiping down to show the Quick Panel and the Settings icon, then tapping "Christina’s Buds4 Pro" to access noise control settings, earbud controls and customizable sound settings. The last section explains how to adjust settings from the Quick Panel. On the screen of the Galaxy smartphone is the media player. To adjust the volume, sound modes and sound settings per app, swipe down to open the Quick Panel. In the final scene, a Galaxy smartphone between a pair of Galaxy Buds4 Pro spins around as circular ripples appear in the background, representing sound waves. The video ends with the Galaxy smartphone tilted on its side, showing the rear cameras, and Galaxy Buds4 Pro floating slightly above the smartphone, with the left earbud slightly higher than the right.</span> </a> 
    </div> 
   </div> 
