   <!-- Head gesture --> 
   <div id="head-gesture" class="buds-head-gesture"> 
    <div class="buds-gallery"> 
     <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible"> 
      <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C26-01">HEAD GESTURE</h3> 
      <p class="common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C26-02">Respond with a simple nod or shake</p> 
     </div> 
     <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C26-03"> Intuitive <strong>nods and shakes</strong> let you respond quickly, from answering calls to talking to Bixby, without lifting a hand. Get what you need effortlessly, even in situations where your hands are busy or when it's not an ideal time to speak.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-23"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-24"></a></sup> </p> 
     <div class="buds-gallery__wrap"> 
      <div class="buds-gallery__big-image"> 
       <picture data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-e3k5m"> 
        <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-headgesture-mo.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
        <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-headgesture.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
        <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-headgesture.jpg?imbypass=true" alt="A person wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro in White, while holding a tumbler in one hand and a bag in the other. Dotted vertical and horizontal lines wrap around her face to show the Head Gesture function available on the Galaxy Buds4 Pro. Call app icon and Bixby icon indicates the two features can be used for Head Gesture." data-copy-set="C26-04"> 
       </picture> 
      </div> 
     </div> 
     <div class="buds-head-gesture__howto"> 
      <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="common-cta-howto js-layer-opener js-howto-popup-opener" aria-label="How to control effortlessly. Open video popup" data-target-layer="#layer-popup-how-to" data-youtube-id="fTYAZEYorns" data-youtube-title="How to control effortlessly" data-howto-slide="how-to-use-effortlessly"> 
       <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"> 
        <use xlink:href="#wearable-play-button" href="#wearable-play-button"></use> 
       </svg> <span data-copy-set="C26-05">How to control effortlessly</span> <span class="blind" aria-hidden="true" data-copy-set="C26-07">Galaxy Buds4 Pro next to a Galaxy smartphone, explaining how to easily pair and control Galaxy Buds4 Pro. Galaxy Bud4 Pro Charging Case opens and a pop-up appears on the screen of the Galaxy smartphone. "Connect" is tapped to pair the devices. The first section introduces how to use Pinch Control with a single Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbud placed in an ear canal. Demonstration of Pinch Control with a single earbud in one ear: single, double, and triple pinch to play/pause, skip forward, and go back; swipe along the earbud to adjust volume; pinch to answer calls and pinch-and-hold to decline. The next section explains how to customize controls on Galaxy Buds4 Pro. A Galaxy smartphone appears, swiping down to show the Quick Panel and the Settings icon, then tapping "Christina’s Buds4 Pro" and "Earbud controls". The second section introduces the new head gestures feature and explains how to set it up. A Galaxy smartphone appears, swiping down to show the Quick Panel and the Settings icon, then tapping "Christina’s Buds4 Pro" and toggling on "Head gestures". The next scene shows a person wearing a single Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbud while nodding to answer and shaking their head to decline a call. The last section explains how to customize voice commands from the settings menu. On the screen of the Galaxy smartphone is the settings menu. Then tap "Christina's Buds4 Pro, "Voice controls" and toggle on "Voice commands" to control Galaxy Buds4 Pro with your voice. In the final scene, a Galaxy smartphone between a pair of Galaxy Buds4 Pro spins around as circular ripples appear in the background, representing sound waves. The video ends with the Galaxy smartphone tilted on its side, showing the rear cameras, and Galaxy Buds4 Pro floating slightly above the smartphone, with the left earbud slightly higher than the right.</span> </a> 
     </div> 
    </div> 
   </div> 
   <div id="buds-parallax04" class="buds-parallax"> 
    <div class="buds-parallax__top"> 
     <!-- Auto Switch --> 
     <div id="auto-switch" class="buds-auto-switch"> 
      <div class="common__headline-wrap visible-text is-visible"> 
       <h3 class="common__eyebrow" data-copy-set="C27-01">AUTO SWITCH</h3> 
       <p class="common__sub-headline" data-copy-set="C27-02">Switch instantly between Galaxy devices</p> 
      </div> 
      <p class="common__description" data-copy-set="C27-03"> <strong>Auto Switch</strong> shifts your audio to the most pressing task at hand. Take a call on your Galaxy smartphone while focusing on your creative project on your Galaxy Tab or Galaxy Book. Jump right back to where you left off, the instant you hang up. The experience is seamless across your Galaxy devices.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-1"></a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-25"></a></sup> </p> 
      <div class="type-video"> 
       <div class="common-video"> 
        <figure class="common-video__wrapper"> 
         <video playsinline muted preload="none" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-2t4y7" data-src-pc="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-autoswitch.mp4" data-src-mobile="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-autoswitch-mo.mp4" aria-label="A pair of white, Galaxy Buds4 Pro with a Galaxy Tab in the middle, indicating the Buds are being used to watch the content. Galaxy smartphone appears, displaying the caller name 'Ava.' Galaxy Buds4 Pro and the smartphone are paired via Bluetooth for the phone call. The smartphone disappears and Galaxy Tab is in the middle again, indicating the Auto Switch feature." data-copy-set="C27-04"></video> 
         <picture class="common-video__start-frame" data-media-lazy data-media-id="media-r7f5x"> 
          <source data-empty media="(min-width:0px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAHAAACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="> 
          <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-autoswitch-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
          <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-autoswitch-mo-tb.jpg?imbypass=true"> 
          <img src="https://images.samsung.com/pk/galaxy-buds4-pro/feature/galaxy-buds4-pro-galaxyexperience-autoswitch-tb.jpg?imbypass=true" alt=""> 
         </picture> 
        </figure> 
        <button type="button" class="common-video__controller" title="Switch instantly between Galaxy devices video" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:galaxy-experience^auto-switch:movi-pause:main-movie" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="feature" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:galaxy-experience^auto-switch:movi-pause:main-movie"> 
